{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">東方海外上半年業績倒退。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">純利按年下跌逾兩成三，至7.2億美元。中期息減少至55美仙。期內，收入則增加百分之6，至51.7億美元。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-28T00:40:07.307231+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":65,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}